799 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Non-profits are directing time and financial resources into fund development, funder reporting, planning, and governance, likely to cope with rising costs and stagnant revenues, among other pressures explored in this report. These investments reflect both necessity and adaptability: organizations are actively strengthening internal capacities to weather challenging times while also working to stabilize their fragile funding. Without reliable revenues, non-profits are forced to redirect time and money from direct community work, programs, services, and activities, to pivot and respond to current challenges.  )
/E (Non-profits are directing time and financial resources into fund development, funder reporting, planning, and governance, likely to cope with rising costs and stagnant revenues, among other pressures explored in this report. These investments reflect both necessity and adaptability: organizations are actively strengthening internal capacities to weather challenging times while also working to stabilize their fragile funding. Without reliable revenues, non-profits are forced to redirect time and money from direct community work, programs, services, and activities, to pivot and respond to current challenges.  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
