802 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Recruitment and retention challenges persist in the non-profit sector due to wage gaps with other sectors, a lack of candidates with the necessary skills for specific roles, especially among rural-serving organizations, and workforce burnout and stress. These challenges continue to limit capacity across the sector. While staffing levels have remained static overall, larger non-profits are more likely to invest in competitive wages and mental health and wellbeing supports, whereas smaller organizations often cannot, leaving their teams stretched and their sustainability at risk. )
/E (Recruitment and retention challenges persist in the non-profit sector due to wage gaps with other sectors, a lack of candidates with the necessary skills for specific roles, especially among rural-serving organizations, and workforce burnout and stress. These challenges continue to limit capacity across the sector. While staffing levels have remained static overall, larger non-profits are more likely to invest in competitive wages and mental health and wellbeing supports, whereas smaller organizations often cannot, leaving their teams stretched and their sustainability at risk. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
