<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Respondents are sounding the alarm that demand from clients and communities is not only higher but also increasingly complex. Meeting this demand requires stable, predictable multi-year funding that directly supports staffing and operational capacity to expand existing programs or introduce new ones. This includes recruiting and retaining staff who are not only qualified and sufficient in number, but also well supported, not overburdened, and fairly compensated. Direct investments in operations enable organizations to strengthen administrative capacity, maintain adequate facilities, engage in data collection and evaluation, and perform other functions essential for meeting evolving community needs.  )
/E (Respondents are sounding the alarm that demand from clients and communities is not only higher but also increasingly complex. Meeting this demand requires stable, predictable multi-year funding that directly supports staffing and operational capacity to expand existing programs or introduce new ones. This includes recruiting and retaining staff who are not only qualified and sufficient in number, but also well supported, not overburdened, and fairly compensated. Direct investments in operations enable organizations to strengthen administrative capacity, maintain adequate facilities, engage in data collection and evaluation, and perform other functions essential for meeting evolving community needs.  )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
